# Rendered and transient files stay local; sources, ledgers, runs and the trace are committed.
/.quarto/
**/*.quarto_ipynb
/_book/
/_generated/
/_quarto-book.yml
/_state/state.json
/_state/*.tmp
/_state/hook-errors.log
/_state/UNRESOLVED.md
**/*.lock
/entries/*/entry.pdf
/entries/*/entry.html
/sessions/*/*.pdf
/sessions/*/*.html
**/__pycache__/
**/texput.log
